Notes / Uwagi

* Graphics and music: all creature sprites, tiles, characters, battle
  backgrounds, sound effects and music in LUMINA are generated procedurally by
  the source code at runtime (Canvas 2D and Web Audio). There are no third-party
  image or audio files in this repository. The generated output is covered by
  this MIT license; the music may additionally be treated as CC0 (public domain
  dedication). The app icons and splash screens in web/icons/ and assets/ were
  also generated by a script and are covered by this license.
  Grafika i muzyka są generowane przez kod gry; w repozytorium nie ma cudzych
  plików graficznych ani dźwiękowych.

* Fonts: "Cinzel", "EB Garamond" and "Press Start 2P" are loaded from Google
  Fonts at runtime and are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL)
  by their respective authors. They are not part of this repository.
  Czcionki są ładowane z Google Fonts i mają licencję SIL OFL 1.1.

* Optional custom music placed by a user in web/music/ is NOT covered by this
  license – it remains under the license chosen by its authors.
  Własna muzyka dodana do web/music/ zachowuje licencję swoich autorów.

* LUMINA is an original game. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or using
  any characters, names or music from other games or franchises.
